<title>USA: AASTROM IPO under way at $7/share.</title>
<headline>AASTROM IPO under way at $7/share.</headline>
<dateline>ANN ARBOR, Mich. 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>AASTROM Biosciences Inc said Tuesday an initial public offering of three million shares at $7 a share was under way.</p>
<p>All of the shares are being sold by AASTROM. Underwriters are led by Cowen &amp; Co and J.P. Morgan &amp; Co.</p>
<p>AASTROM said it expects proceeds, together with available cash, will be sufficient to satisfy its research and development and other working capital requirements until mid-1998.</p>
<p>AASTROM is developing proprietary process technologies and devices for a range of cell therapy applications, including stem cell therapies and gene therapies.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
